raw_discovery_candidates.cheap_validation:
Backtest on all disputed Polymarket questions from 2025-2026, using lifecycle datasets such as Nechepurenko's. Record the price at dispute start and the final ruling.

Pass:
- unanimous-jury subset accuracy >= 95% with n >= 100;
- mean entry discount >= 3c;
- simulated PnL positive after assigning a full loss to misses.

Fail if the unanimous subset is under 30% of disputes (too rare to bother) or if the misses cluster in high-value markets.
